+        "A JSON matrix with exactly k rows [a,0]; after the immediate identity "
+        "L_i^2=1, row i is one of the two distinct affine encodings "
+        "offset_i-scale_i or offset_i+scale_i modulo p_i."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
